            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lleva un audio o un video al borde de arriba y la píldora se abre para recibirlo. Cuando termina, arrastra la transcripción a donde la quieras, o haz clic para copiarla. Si la dejas ahí, se guarda sola.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag an audio or video file to the top edge and the pill opens to take it. When it finishes, drag the transcript wherever you want it, or click to copy. Leave it and it saves itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que cambias se ve acá al instante": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you change shows up here right away"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que cambies aplica al próximo dictado.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes apply to the next dictation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que dibuja la píldora mientras te escucha": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What the HUD draws while it listens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que recibe el modelo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What the model receives"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que terminas de dictar lo reescribe el modelo de Apple que corre acá mismo, antes de pegarlo. Nada sale de esta compu.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you finish dictating is rewritten by Apple's model running right here, before it is pasted. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que va dentro del halo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
